<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has destroyed bridges in Arakan, moved west of the Sittaung River, and is planning a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border while an airstrike hit a displacement camp in Rakhine. In Sagaing, junta forces killed 11 people as Starlink outages isolated communities and health-care facilities continued to be attacked in October 2026. Gold revenues now fund resistance groups and Myanmar-linked arsenic pollution is driving a clean-water scramble in Thailand. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c804wzp20ddvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/19/world/myanmar-icj-ruling-genocide&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/asia/icj-myanmar-gaza.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOMHJpYkFmNFJ4WWUwUDA2YU5nWGJGRUFsZnZHOEtPSndaT01CYTI1MVNVWTdDbG1PSFJYTWgweXBNb3ZkeUx2RWNGZVpERi1WNzlxRTNVbEtnRU56LVJrUG5fVXdCaWdKeS1JMG1Rd1FuZi0zRmlJdU0zaHZrNVBJZ3ZoRVRlSnMwNVh5Vms5SlJ6YWN2Ri1fNmdRRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/19/rohingya-genocide-survivor-perpetrators-will-have-to-face?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/19/what-does-the-myanmar-genocide-ruling-mean-for-the-rohingya?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxPbzZlQXBMbFU3Qzl0M2E